# 실행 환경은 local을 선택하세요. 실제 테스트 비밀번호는 private 환경 파일에서 관리합니다.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### 1. 가입 성공 → 201, role=MEMBER
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"loginId":"runner01","password":"{{testSignupPassword}}","nickname":"첫러너"}

### 2. 같은 아이디로 또 가입 → 409 DUPLICATE_LOGIN_ID
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"loginId":"runner01","password":"{{testSignupPassword}}","nickname":"첫러너"}

### 3. role=LEADER 몰래 넣기 → 201인데 role은 MEMBER
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"loginId":"runner02","password":"{{testSignupPassword}}","nickname":"둘째","role":"LEADER"}

### 4. 대문자·3글자 아이디 → 400 INVALID_INPUT
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"loginId":"ABC","password":"{{testSignupPassword}}","nickname":"대문자"}

### 5. 비번 7자 → 400 INVALID_INPUT
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"loginId":"runner03","password":"{{testShortPassword}}","nickname":"짧은비번"}

### 6. 로그인 성공 → 200, Set-Cookie
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"loginId":"runner01","password":"{{testSignupPassword}}"}

### 7. 비번 틀림 → 401 LOGIN_FAILED
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"loginId":"runner01","password":"{{testPassword1}}"}

### 8. 없는 아이디 → 401 LOGIN_FAILED (7번이랑 똑같은 응답이어야 함)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"loginId":"nobody","password":"{{testSignupPassword}}"}

### 9. 재발급 → 200, 새 Set-Cookie (6번에서 받은 쿠키를 IntelliJ가 자동으로 보냄)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/refresh

### 10. 로그아웃 → 204, Set-Cookie에 Max-Age=0
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/logout

### 11. 쿠키 지운 뒤 재발급 → 401 TOKEN_FAILED
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/refresh

### 12. 로그인하고 access 자동 저장
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"loginId":"runner01","password":"{{testSignupPassword}}"}

> {% client.global.set("access", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 13. 내 정보 → 200
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### 14. 출입증 없이 → 401 TOKEN_FAILED (경비원이 막음)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/me

### 15. 닉네임 수정 → 200, 새 닉네임
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nickname":"달리는첫러너"}

### 16. 닉네임 1자 → 400 INVALID_INPUT
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nickname":"김"}

### 17. leader 로그인 → leaderToken 저장
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"loginId":"leader","password":"{{testPassword2}}"}

> {% client.global.set("leaderToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 18. member 로그인 → memberToken 저장
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"loginId":"member","password":"{{testPassword3}}"}

> {% client.global.set("memberToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 19. MEMBER가 목록 → 403
GET {{base}}/api/v1/runners
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### 20. LEADER가 목록 → 200, id 1·2·3·4 순서
GET {{base}}/api/v1/runners
Authorization: Bearer {{leaderToken}}

### 21. MEMBER(4번)가 본인 조회 → 200
GET {{base}}/api/v1/runners/4
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### 22. MEMBER가 남(3번) 조회 → 403
GET {{base}}/api/v1/runners/3
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### 23. MEMBER가 없는 번호(999) 조회 → 403 (404 아님!)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/runners/999
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### 24. LEADER가 없는 번호(999) 조회 → 404
GET {{base}}/api/v1/runners/999
Authorization: Bearer {{leaderToken}}

### 25. 숫자 아닌 id → 400
GET {{base}}/api/v1/runners/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{leaderToken}}

### 26. runner01 로그인 → runnerToken 저장 (MEMBER, id 1)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"loginId":"runner01","password":"{{testSignupPassword}}"}

> {% client.global.set("runnerToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 27. MEMBER가 역할 변경 → 403
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/runners/2/role
Authorization: Bearer {{runnerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"LEADER"}

### 28. LEADER가 본인 역할 변경 → 400 CANNOT_CHANGE_OWN_ROLE
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/runners/3/role
Authorization: Bearer {{leaderToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"MEMBER"}

### 29. LEADER가 member(4번)를 LEADER로 승격 → 200
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/runners/4/role
Authorization: Bearer {{leaderToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"LEADER"}

### 30. 승격된 member의 "옛날 토큰"으로 목록 → 200 (아까 19번은 403이었음!)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/runners
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### 31. 이상한 역할 KING → 400
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/runners/2/role
Authorization: Bearer {{leaderToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"KING"}

### 32. LEADER 본인 삭제 → 400 CANNOT_DELETE_SELF
DELETE {{base}}/api/v1/runners/3
Authorization: Bearer {{leaderToken}}

### 33. MEMBER(runner01)가 남(2번) 삭제 → 403
DELETE {{base}}/api/v1/runners/2
Authorization: Bearer {{runnerToken}}

### 34. LEADER가 없는 번호 삭제 → 404
DELETE {{base}}/api/v1/runners/999
Authorization: Bearer {{leaderToken}}

### 35. MEMBER(runner01)가 본인(1번) 삭제 → 204
DELETE {{base}}/api/v1/runners/1
Authorization: Bearer {{runnerToken}}

### 36. 삭제된 runner01 토큰으로 내 정보 → 401
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{runnerToken}}